{"case_id":"kq-091","case_sha256":"847dbee26586e29dd3806efabf7c728fa29295df06c3adeeeee7ad47504ff67b","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs04"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:loanconfirm2026"],"answer":"已知经办银行是国开行。请先确认你的毕业届次。当前取得的是2026届贷款毕业确认通知，不能直接当作你当前适用的流程。确认后请从经办银行官方渠道或资助管理中心核对现行手续；收到短信时先核实来源。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":2447.0876000004864,"cost_usd":0.0004299,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
