{"case_id":"kq-013","case_sha256":"73c4792d09e4d3ae384ae90497d470e669bcf6a41b65d5c7923fe22b5991fe50","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:05","cdut:candidate-office:03","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:03","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:candidate-office:03","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:05"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"教材征订与发放归教务处教材建设科负责，该科承担教材管理、选用审核、征订与发放等事务。资料记载的办公地点为办公楼106室、6B107-2，电话028-84078905、028-84079924；但来源适用的校区尚未确认，地点和电话也需以最新核对结果为准。去之前建议先拨打上述电话，确认当前办理地点和受理时间。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5972.005500000705,"cost_usd":0.00239862,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-014","case_sha256":"2a8013001470c0e1a25715556bcfb1958dea6211a0755e285ad3906692fcd5dd","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:06","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:30","cdut:candidate-office:04","cdut:chunk:xscoffices:02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:06","cdut:candidate-office:04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"由教务处实践教学科负责：实践教学、毕业设计（论文）、实验项目及大学生竞赛等事务。资料记载的办公地点为办公楼107室，电话028-84078931；但该材料的适用校区尚未确认，前往前建议先电话核实。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":4068.2218999991164,"cost_usd":0.00110727,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-015","case_sha256":"58789ffd07880c2dbc1a19ebe49dd0edc5c85c96eb4f14101e2f79df5ee6d620","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:04","cdut:candidate-office:02","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:03","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:04"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:candidate-office:02","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"由教务处质量建设与智慧教学科承担，职责包括本科培养方案、专业建设、课程建设与教改等工作。官网所列地点为办公楼105室，公开电话为028-84078883；不过，资料来源尚未确认适用校区，建议前往前先通过电话核实。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":3921.735799999624,"cost_usd":0.00111471,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-016","case_sha256":"2bdee8918a255b71dd05376b5ba301f78404a3af9e8134563d470339a0fa5792","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs16","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs16"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:freshman-guide-2026","cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"校医院简介将其列为“校内非营利性公立医院、大学生医保首诊医院”。其中“大学生医保首诊医院”指它是大学生门诊的首诊医疗机构，参保学生在校医院就诊可按政策报销。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5985.2131999996345,"cost_usd":0.00230559,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-017","case_sha256":"419c32a93e839a0aaca74a52f1d7811e2d78859e93f475ece20fbb90ad9a38b8","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs01","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:hospoverview","cdut:source:freshman-guide-2026"],"answer":"是的，成都理工大学医院设有口腔科，也设有检验科；其中检验科属于医技科室。口腔科还提供工作日午间和周末延时服务。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":3401.1767000001782,"cost_usd":0.0021447,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
