{"case_id":"kq-019","case_sha256":"04da193cfdc0c731ce4a79b6eccfa8da7dd26b7d32d243edf72a8a69d1dd7c53","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02","cdut:chunk:cistwork2025:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs16"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:hospoverview"],"answer":"校医院检验科与第三方检测机构长期合作，对本院不能自行开展的实验室检测项目，采取标本外送检测的方式处理。该安排见校医院“现有检查项目”说明，统计截至2026年2月，资料未注明适用校区。若需外送，建议就诊时向检验科确认具体标本采集与送检安排。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":4081.8506999994497,"cost_usd":0.001242426,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
