{"case_id":"kq-031","case_sha256":"1320245b8a5bc5a7b8b5679bdff729af4c060b3c170cb1b9d54b721ed822c109","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027"],"answer":"不能。按《关于2026—2027学年第一学期选课的通知》，必须在选课前完成学费缴纳及注册，否则无法选课；缴费问题请咨询财务处。该通知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准；本学期选课已于2026年9月14日18:00结束，结束后一律不能补选、退选。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":7744.804699999804,"cost_usd":0.002362632,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-032","case_sha256":"b1a68277ded2f35aed161eed0f51ee3ef7c40b03f8f8b2db16c4419060f8ecb1","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:15","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:03","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027"],"answer":"应关注第2轮选课（非计划课阶段）：通知中将该轮明确标注为“跨年级、跨专业选课”，时间为2026年7月9日13:00至9月14日18:00。但该通知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准；本轮选课窗口已于9月14日结束，当前（10月17日）不能再按此轮次办理。来源未说明适用校区。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5328.0729999996765,"cost_usd":0.002042154,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-033","case_sha256":"8b90f0c47da6d90f870faf2e381ee3f2af9242ae28c478002ea95e508877e82b","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:04","cdut:chunk:expand-cet:01","cdut:chunk:cet2026h1:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027","cdut:source:xjgl2019"],"answer":"不需要。按选课通知，本学期若已用大学英语四、六级成绩替代大学英语课程，就不必再选相应课程（该通知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准）。前提是你属非英语专业，且开课时止两年内四级折百分制达75分或六级达65分，并填写《课程替代及免修申请表》，经系部审核、学院审批后报教务处备案；未办妥替代手续，仍须选课，否则成绩不予记载。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":6063.355500000398,"cost_usd":0.001964172,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-034","case_sha256":"90d50a17eca9edb647aec9f0feb547532570b3e2f48eb226b2a1c801956a61ac","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027"],"answer":"不能。按教务处2026年6月26日发布的2026—2027学年第一学期选课通知，两轮选课均于2026年9月14日18:00结束，并明确“选课结束后，一律不能补、退选课程”；今天已是10月17日，选课已结束。该通知可能已过期，请以教务处最新通知为准。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5312.2717999995075,"cost_usd":0.001781622,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-035","case_sha256":"abefc8df6aa3e46d3506f8939f4509fc11be9aeb1bfb46b641b2b42808e28715","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01","cdut:candidate-office:05","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:11"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027"],"answer":"不允许。教务处明确：选课仅限在学校教务系统操作，严禁使用第三方抢课软件、脚本外挂；学校会实时监测异常访问，一经查实将取消本次所有选课结果，并按校规处理（依据2026-2027学年第一学期选课通知，内容可能已过期，请以最新通知为准）。建议直接在教务系统内完成选课。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5083.860000000641,"cost_usd":0.001431636,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-036","case_sha256":"dba729cf02a3cd3366a52891a8196a54b30837351272e30ff59a996b4c1d210d","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:29","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:07","cdut:chunk:wx:fresh2026fee:04"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:wx:fresh2026fee:04","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:29"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026","cdut:source:wx:fresh2026fee"],"answer":"不能直接套用。医保按属地原则：成都校区学生参加成都市城乡居民基本医疗保险，宜宾校区学生则按宜宾市当地政策执行；参保缴费标准和医保待遇都以宜宾市规定为准，具体可查看宜宾校区官网通知。上述依据可能已过期，请以最新通知为准（校医院医保办咨询电话 028-84077361）。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":6403.25539999958,"cost_usd":0.002279682,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-037","case_sha256":"b876b18a54c3c009989a65627e37d37e55811ba2ee30cd3595ef239fbc680003","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:wx:fee20262027:03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:wx:fee20262027:03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"不是。办理助学贷款并不免除医保缴费：资料明确“办理助学贷款的学生如需参加2026年成都大学生医保，需自行按学校财务处公布的缴费方式完成缴费”（该须知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准）。医保本身属于自愿参保。另需注意，2026年集中参保缴费原则上截至2025年12月20日左右，现已逾期；该结论适用于在成都参保的学生，宜宾校区按当地政策执行，且来源适用校区尚未确认。如需补办，可咨询校医院医保办杨老师，电话028-84077361。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":7053.813399999854,"cost_usd":0.002985078,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-038","case_sha256":"c5073194f0bb310c774eb38957d58643bcdfcbc4f135750d4276ecfb3f52afd9","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:official:tuition-2026:insurance-notice","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:official:tuition-2026:insurance-notice"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"按《2026年成都理工大学学生城乡基本医疗保险购买须知》，延迟毕业和休学学生如需参保，先由学院统一收集学生姓名、学号及缴费金额；学院再将纸质版盖章后交财务处信息管理中心俞老师生成费用信息，学生再按财务处公布的缴费方式缴费。该通知发布于2025年10月，可能已过期，请以最新通知为准；校区适用范围尚未确认，宜宾校区按当地政策执行。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":6064.977500000168,"cost_usd":0.002801592,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-039","case_sha256":"47ea4c9ed26aca7bd0b6f81d2c1816e1c4abf95f39e21f044352365b58c5c5c2","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"不是立即享受。按2026年参保须知，集中参保期外未购学生需先经学院登记、再由医保办通知缴费，自缴费之日起90天后（不含第90天）才可享受大学生医保待遇；宜宾校区按宜宾市当地政策执行。该须知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5976.552400000401,"cost_usd":0.002532984,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
