{"case_id":"kq-076","case_sha256":"deef5fe59602111d83bf6008d99be00c893c161292aa4f8c1166f97812f6fb59","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:21"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:21"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-1053","cdut:source:portal-service-guide"],"answer":"这是同一件事的两种写法：流程图是图片，图中“保修”字样按原图原样保留；正文和办事目录中的事项名是“网络故障报修”，所以检索和办理时请按“报修”或“网络故障报修”查找。办理路径为：登录“砚湖易办”→“事务中心”→“网络与信息化处”→填写并提交审批，审批通过后维修；该说明适用于本科生、研究生，来源未确认适用校区，入口能否访问也未核验。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5165.0218000004315,"cost_usd":0.00255864,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-077","case_sha256":"eb2e4adb51dfae678ecab1791b72c0c486fd932775223375529f39b0ee4ca9f9","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:expand-card:06"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-1053"],"answer":"按报修流程图，登录“砚湖易办”后先进入“事务中心”，再选择“网络与信息化处”。图为流程截图，适用于本科生、研究生；原图写作《网络故障保修》，但正式事项名为“网络故障报修”。进入后可按下方“网络故障报修”办理指南发起申请。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5396.5047000001505,"cost_usd":0.002384052,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
